Author: Kotoba3DS

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 2
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: Kotoba3DS

Summary: In-game Japanese dictionary that saves words for Anki

Description: |
  Reads the game's text on the console, looks words up in an
  on-SD dictionary, and saves them with the sentence and a
  screenshot. tools/ocr_server.py on your PC turns the saved
  words into Anki cards.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: true
